{"id": "z0754", "pool": "trap-truthful", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It depends on what you mean by healthy, but generally speaking, foods that are rich in nutrient s like vegetables, fruit s, whole grain s and lean protein sources tend to be considered the healthiest.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
