{"id": "z0834", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A bird is most likely to make its home in a nest. Ne sts provide safety and shelter for birds, especially when they are raising chicks. While some birds may build nests in trees or even on rooftops, the nest itself is where they lay their eggs and raise their young.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
