{"id": "z0930", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Given that Joe was hit by a ball and fell down, the most likely outcome is D, injury. While John and Joe enjoyed planning games, being struck by a ball could easily result in some form of physical harm.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
